{"title":"2005.08543 Necessary and Sufficient Conditions for Causal Feature Selection in Time Series with Latent Common Causes","markdown":{"headingText":"2005.08543 Necessary and Sufficient Conditions for Causal Feature Selection in Time Series with Latent Common Causes","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"- 作者/日期/来源：Atalanti A. Mastakouri, Bernhard Schölkopf, Dominik Janzing；2020-05-18（v3 2020-10-22）；arXiv:2005.08543\n- **一句话定位**：提出 SyPI（Systematic Path Isolation）算法，在存在隐变量混杂的时间序列中，用每个候选序列仅两次条件独立性（conditional independence, CI）检验识别目标序列的直接与间接原因，并给出必要且充分条件。\n- **研究问题**：给定目标时间序列 Y 与候选集合 X（可能被未观测序列 U 混杂，即不满足因果充分性 causal sufficiency），如何从纯观测数据判定哪些 X^i 是 Y 的（直接/间接）原因；Granger 因果在此设定下会产生大量误报。\n- **模型与方法**：在\"全时间图（full time graph）\"（以 X_t^i、Y_t、U_t^j 为节点的无穷 DAG）与\"摘要图（summary graph）\"两层表述下工作。核心概念：sg-unconfounded 因果路径（在全时间图中存在、且在摘要图中不构成混杂路径的因果边）、滞后 lag v（存在不含同序列相邻时刻链 X_{t'}^r→X_{t'+1}^r 的无碰撞路径 X_t^i↝Y_{t+v}）、单滞后/多滞后依赖。标准假设 A1–A5（马尔可夫、忠实性、无时间反向边、平稳、无环），图约束 A6–A9（Y 为汇聚节点 sink；每个序列有一阶自回归边 X_{t-1}^i→X_t^i；无 s>1 的自边；直接作用于 Y 的隐变量须无记忆且与 Y 单滞后）。方法直觉：隔离路径 X_{t-1}^i→X_t^i- -Q_{t'}^j↝Y_{t+w_i}，构造条件集 S^i（含 Y_{t+w_i-1} 及每个其他序列进入该节点的那个时刻的节点）；若 X_t^i 与 Y_{t+w_i} 之间存在混杂路径，则 X_t^i 是碰撞节点，条件于它便打通 X_{t-1}^i 与 Y_{t+w_i} 的路径，据此区分因果与混杂依赖。\n- **主要命题/定理**：Theorem 1a（单滞后图，A1–A5）：若条件 (1) X_t^i \\not\\perp Y_{t+w_i} | {S^i, Y_{t+w_i-1}} 与 (2) X_{t-1}^i \\perp Y_{t+w_i} | {S^i, X_t^i, Y_{t+w_i-1}} 同时成立，则 X_t^i↝Y_{t+w_i} 且该路径 sg-unconfounded（充分性）。Theorem 1b 将充分条件推广到多滞后图。Theorem 2（加 A6–A9）：若 X_t^i 是直接的 sg-unconfounded 原因，则条件 1、2 必然成立（必要性），故对直接无混杂原因条件是充要的。Lemma 1/2 说明可用回归（lasso）从数据中估出最小滞后 w_j 且不破坏定理。经验结果：模拟中每个配置 100 个随机图（样本 500–3000、隐变量 0–2、观测序列 1–8、噪声 10–30%），FPR < 1%（样本 >500 时与图规模、噪声无关），直接原因 FNR 约 12%（小稀疏图）至 45%（大稠密图）；对比 Lasso-Granger（FPR 达 16%）、seqICP（FPR 约 12%、FNR 约 95%）、PCMCI（FPR 达 25%），SyPI 均更优。真实数据：欧盟奶制品价格，按工艺知识设\"Raw Milk→Butter\"，德国与爱尔兰数据识别出 Raw Milk 为原因，英国（缺 Raw Milk 数据、充当隐混杂场景）未识别出任何原因，与预期一致。\n- **在因果研究脉络中的角色**：把 Mastakouri et al. (2019) 的非时序因果特征选择条件推广到时间序列，是少数在隐混杂时序设定下给出可识别性充要条件的工作；与 PCMCI、seqICP 同期，代表了从\"全图发现\"转向\"目标中心特征选择\"的路线。\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":""},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":true,"output":true,"warning":true,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown"},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"scroll","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-tools":false,"tbl-colwidths":"auto","merge-includes":true,"inline-includes":false,"preserve-yaml":false,"latex-auto-mk":true,"latex-auto-install":true,"latex-clean":true,"latex-min-runs":1,"latex-max-runs":10,"latex-makeindex":"makeindex","latex-makeindex-opts":[],"latex-tlmgr-opts":[],"latex-input-paths":[],"latex-output-dir":null,"link-external-icon":false,"link-external-newwindow":false,"self-contained-math":false,"format-resources":[],"notebook-links":true},"pandoc":{"standalone":true,"wrap":"none","default-image-extension":"png","to":"html","output-file":"2005.08543.html"},"language":{"toc-title-document":"目录","toc-title-website":"该页面内容","related-formats-title":"其他格式","related-notebooks-title":"笔记本","source-notebooks-prefix":"资源","other-links-title":"其他链接","code-links-title":"代码链接","launch-dev-container-title":"启动 Dev Container","launch-binder-title":"启动 Binder","article-notebook-label":"文章笔记本","notebook-preview-download":"下载笔记本","notebook-preview-download-src":"下载源代码","notebook-preview-back":"返回文章","manuscript-meca-bundle":"MECA 存档","section-title-abstract":"摘要","section-title-appendices":"附录","section-title-fo